anslation_id":85,"en":"If they gain the upper hand over you, they will revert to being your enemies and stretch out their hands and tongues to harm you; it is their dearest wish that you may renounce your faith.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَثْقَفُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"they gain dominance over you","transliteration":"yathqafūkum","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"they would be","transliteration":"yakūnū","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَعْدَآءًۭ","en_gloss":"enemies","transliteration":"aʿdāan","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَبْسُطُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"and extend","transliteration":"wayabsuṭū","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِلَيْكُمْ","en_gloss":"against you","transliteration":"ilaykum","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَيْدِيَهُمْ","en_gloss":"their hands","transliteration":"aydiyahum","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأَلْسِنَتَهُم","en_gloss":"and their tongues","transliteration":"wa-alsinatahum","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":10,"ar":"بِٱلسُّوٓءِ","en_gloss":"with evil","transliteration":"bil-sūi","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَوَدُّوا۟","en_gloss":"and they desire","transliteration":"wawaddū","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لَوْ","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"law","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":13,"ar":"تَكْفُرُونَ","en_gloss":"you would disbelieve","transliteration":"takfurūna","verse_key":"60:2"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٢","en_gloss":"(2)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"60:2"}]},{"verse_key":"60:3","surah":60,"ayah":3,"ar_uthmani":"لَن تَنفَعَكُمْ أَرْحَامُكُمْ وَلَآ أَوْلَـٰدُكُمْ ۚ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ يَفْصِلُ بَيْنَكُمْ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ بَصِيرٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Neither your kinsfolk nor your children will be any use to you on the Day of Resurrection: He will separate you out. God sees everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَن","en_gloss":"Never","transliteration":"lan","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَنفَعَكُمْ","en_gloss":"will benefit you","transliteration":"tanfaʿakum","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَرْحَامُكُمْ","en_gloss":"your relatives","transliteration":"arḥāmukum","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَلَآ","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":5,"ar":"أَوْلَـٰدُكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"your children","transliteration":"awlādukum","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","en_gloss":"(of) the Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَفْصِلُ","en_gloss":"He will judge","transliteration":"yafṣilu","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بَيْنَكُمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"between you","transliteration":"baynakum","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":11,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":12,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بَصِيرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Seer","transliteration":"baṣīrun","verse_key":"60:3"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٣","en_gloss":"(3)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"60:3"}]},{"verse_key":"60:4","surah":60,"ayah":4,"ar_uthmani":"قَدْ كَانَتْ لَكُمْ أُسْوَةٌ حَسَنَةٌ فِىٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ وَٱلَّذِينَ مَعَهُۥٓ إِذْ قَالُوا۟ لِقَوْمِهِمْ إِنَّا بُرَءَٰٓؤُا۟ مِنكُمْ وَمِمَّا تَعْبُدُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ كَفَرْنَا بِكُمْ وَبَدَا بَيْنَنَا وَبَيْنَكُمُ ٱلْعَدَٰوَةُ وَٱلْبَغْضَآءُ أَبَدًا حَتَّىٰ تُؤْمِنُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ وَحْدَهُۥٓ إِلَّا قَوْلَ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ لِأَبِيهِ لَأَسْتَغْفِرَنَّ لَكَ وَمَآ أَمْلِكُ لَكَ مِنَ ٱللَّهِ مِن شَىْءٍ ۖ رَّبَّنَا عَلَيْكَ تَوَكَّلْنَا وَإِلَيْكَ أَنَبْنَا وَإِلَيْكَ ٱلْمَصِيرُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You have a good example in Abraham and his companions, when they said to their people, ‘We disown you and what you worship besides God! We renounce you! Until you believe in God alone, the enmity and hatred that has arisen between us will endure!’––except when Abraham said to his father, ‘I will pray for forgiveness for you though I cannot protect you from God’––[they prayed] ‘Lord, we have put our trust in You; we turn to You; You are our final destination.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَتْ","en_gloss":"(there) is","transliteration":"kānat","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَكُمْ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُسْوَةٌ","en_gloss":"an example","transliteration":"us'watun","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":5,"ar":"حَسَنَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"good","transliteration":"ḥasanatun","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":7,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīma","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَعَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"maʿahu","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":10,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":11,"ar":"قَالُوا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":12,"ar":"لِقَوْمِهِمْ","en_gloss":"to their people","transliteration":"liqawmihim","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":13,"ar":"إِنَّا","en_gloss":"Indeed, we","transliteration":"innā","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بُرَءَٰٓؤُا۟","en_gloss":"(are) disassociated","transliteration":"buraāu","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنكُمْ","en_gloss":"from you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":16,"ar":"وَمِمَّا","en_gloss":"and from what","transliteration":"wamimmā","verse_key":"60:4"},{"pos":17,"ar":"تَعْبُدُونَ","en_gloss":"you worship","transliterati